WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.600
Today, a new moon is in the sky, a 23-inch metal sphere placed in orbit by a Russian

00:10.600 --> 00:11.600
rocket.

00:11.600 --> 00:13.600
Here, an artist's conception of how the feat was accomplished.

00:13.600 --> 00:18.500
A three-stage rocket, number one, the booster in the class of an intercontinental missile.

00:18.500 --> 00:20.780
Its weight estimated at 50 tons.

00:20.780 --> 00:25.480
The smaller second stage took over at 5,000 miles an hour and carried on to the highest

00:25.480 --> 00:26.480
point reached.

00:26.480 --> 00:31.960
500 miles up, the artificial moon is boosted to a speed counterbalancing the pull of gravity

00:31.960 --> 00:35.840
and released.

00:35.840 --> 00:40.280
You are hearing the actual signals transmitted by the Earth Circling Satellite, one of the

00:40.280 --> 00:57.120
great scientific feats of the age.

